{"seq":2,"slug":"lookahead-and-lookbehind","title":"前瞻与后顾断言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/advanced-patterns/lookahead-and-lookbehind","wordCount":902,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"前瞻与后顾断言\">前瞻与后顾断言</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前瞻（Lookahead）与后顾（Lookbehind）是零宽断言的高级形式：它们检查某个位置<strong>前后</strong>是否满足条件，但不消费任何字符、也不包含在最终结果中。四种组合覆盖&quot;后面是/不是、前面是/不是&quot;的全部分支。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>正向前瞻 <code>(?=...)</code>、负向前瞻 <code>(?!...)</code>、正向后顾 <code>(?&lt;=...)</code>、负向后顾 <code>(?&lt;!...)</code>。</li>\n<li>多个前瞻可叠加在同一位置，实现&quot;逻辑与&quot;——这是密码强度验证的经典技巧。</li>\n<li>后顾断言的跨语言支持差异明显：JavaScript 支持变长，Python 仅限定长，Go (RE2) 完全不支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"断言的本质\">断言的本质</h2><p>前瞻（Lookahead）和后顾（Lookbehind）是零宽断言的高级形式。它们检查某个位置前后是否满足指定条件，但不消费任何字符，不包含在最终匹配结果中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const priceWithCurrency = /\\d+(?=元)/;&#10;priceWithCurrency.exec(&#39;100元&#39;);&#10;&#10;const priceWithoutCurrency = /(?&lt;=\\$)\\d+/;&#10;priceWithoutCurrency.exec(&#39;$100&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> priceWithCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?=元)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">priceWithCurrency.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100元'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> priceWithoutCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">priceWithoutCurrency.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$100'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>断言类型</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>别名</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正向前瞻</td>\n<td><code>(?=...)</code></td>\n<td>后面必须匹配</td>\n<td>Positive Lookahead</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负向前瞻</td>\n<td><code>(?!...)</code></td>\n<td>后面必须不匹配</td>\n<td>Negative Lookahead</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正向后顾</td>\n<td><code>(?&lt;=...)</code></td>\n<td>前面必须匹配</td>\n<td>Positive Lookbehind</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负向后顾</td>\n<td><code>(?&lt;!...)</code></td>\n<td>前面必须不匹配</td>\n<td>Negative Lookbehind</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ASSERT[&quot;零宽断言&quot;] --&gt; AHEAD[&quot;前瞻 Lookahead&quot;]&#10;    ASSERT --&gt; BEHIND[&quot;后顾 Lookbehind&quot;]&#10;    AHEAD --&gt; POS_A[&quot;正向 (?=...)&quot;]&#10;    AHEAD --&gt; NEG_A[&quot;负向 (?!...)&quot;]&#10;    BEHIND --&gt; POS_B[&quot;正向 (?&lt;=...)&quot;]&#10;    BEHIND --&gt; NEG_B[&quot;负向 (?&lt;!...)&quot;]&#10;    POS_A --&gt; PA[&quot;后面必须是X&quot;]&#10;    NEG_A --&gt; NA[&quot;后面必须不是X&quot;]&#10;    POS_B --&gt; PB[&quot;前面必须是X&quot;]&#10;    NEG_B --&gt; NB[&quot;前面必须不是X&quot;]\">graph TD\n    ASSERT[\"零宽断言\"] --&gt; AHEAD[\"前瞻 Lookahead\"]\n    ASSERT --&gt; BEHIND[\"后顾 Lookbehind\"]\n    AHEAD --&gt; POS_A[\"正向 (?=...)\"]\n    AHEAD --&gt; NEG_A[\"负向 (?!...)\"]\n    BEHIND --&gt; POS_B[\"正向 (?&lt;=...)\"]\n    BEHIND --&gt; NEG_B[\"负向 (?&lt;!...)\"]\n    POS_A --&gt; PA[\"后面必须是X\"]\n    NEG_A --&gt; NA[\"后面必须不是X\"]\n    POS_B --&gt; PB[\"前面必须是X\"]\n    NEG_B --&gt; NB[\"前面必须不是X\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"正向前瞻\">正向前瞻</h2><p><code>(?=...)</code> 要求当前位置之后的字符必须匹配指定模式，但不消费这些字符。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const beforeUnit = /\\d+(?=px)/g;&#10;&#39;width: 100px; height: 200em&#39;.match(beforeUnit);&#10;&#10;const passwordStrength = /^(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*[a-z])(?=.*\\d)(?=.*[!@#$%]).{8,}$/;&#10;passwordStrength.test(&#39;Abc123!@&#39;);&#10;passwordStrength.test(&#39;abcdefgh&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> beforeUnit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?=px)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'width: 100px; height: 200em'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(beforeUnit);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> passwordStrength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[A-Z]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)(?=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-z]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)(?=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)(?=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[!@#$%]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{8,}$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">passwordStrength.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Abc123!@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">passwordStrength.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abcdefgh'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 引擎&#10;    participant S as &quot;100px&quot;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: \\\\d+ 匹配 &quot;100&quot;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: (?=px) 检查后面是否为 &quot;px&quot;&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;E: 是 &quot;px&quot;,断言成功&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: 最终结果:&quot;100&quot;(不含 px)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 引擎\n    participant S as \"100px\"\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: \\\\d+ 匹配 \"100\"\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: (?=px) 检查后面是否为 \"px\"\n    S--&gt;&gt;E: 是 \"px\",断言成功\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: 最终结果:\"100\"(不含 px)</pre><p>多个前瞻可以叠加在同一位置，实现&quot;与&quot;逻辑：</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>(?=.*[A-Z])</code></td>\n<td>至少含一个大写字母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(?=.*\\d)</code></td>\n<td>至少含一个数字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*\\d)</code></td>\n<td>同时满足以上两个条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*\\d)(?=.*[!@#$%]).{8,}</code></td>\n<td>大写+数字+特殊字符+长度≥8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> 前瞻叠加是实现密码强度验证的经典技巧。每个前瞻独立检查一个条件，它们共同构成了&quot;同时满足多个条件&quot;的逻辑与效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"负向前瞻\">负向前瞻</h2><p><code>(?!...)</code> 要求当前位置之后的字符必须<strong>不匹配</strong>指定模式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const notFollowedByPx = /\\d+(?!px)/g;&#10;&#39;width: 100px; count: 200&#39;.match(notFollowedByPx);&#10;&#10;const notJsFile = /\\w+\\.(?!js\\b)\\w+/g;&#10;&#39;app.js style.css utils.ts&#39;.match(notJsFile);&#10;&#10;const notReserved = /\\b(?!if\\b|for\\b|while\\b)\\w+\\b/g;&#10;&#39;if count for total while loop done&#39;.match(notReserved);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> notFollowedByPx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?!px)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'width: 100px; count: 200'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(notFollowedByPx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> notJsFile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?!js</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app.js style.css utils.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(notJsFile);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> notReserved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?!if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">while</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'if count for total while loop done'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(notReserved);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><p>| 场景             | 模式            | 匹配结果          |\n| ---------------- | --------------- | ----------------- | ---------- |\n| 非 px 单位的数字 | <code>\\d+(?!px)</code>     | 非 px 前缀的数字  |\n| 非 js 扩展名     | <code>\\.(?!js\\b)\\w+</code> | 非 <code>.js</code> 的扩展名 |\n| 非保留字的标识符 | <code>(?!if\\b        | for\\b)\\w+</code>        | 排除保留字 |</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"后顾断言\">后顾断言</h2><p><code>(?&lt;=...)</code> 和 <code>(?&lt;!...)</code> 分别检查当前位置<strong>之前</strong>的字符是否匹配或不匹配指定模式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const afterDollar = /(?&lt;=\\$)\\d+(\\.\\d{2})?/g;&#10;&#39;Price: $99.99 or €50.00&#39;.match(afterDollar);&#10;&#10;const notAfterMinus = /(?&lt;!-)\\b\\d+\\b/g;&#10;&#39;a 10 b -20 c 30&#39;.match(notAfterMinus);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> afterDollar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Price: $99.99 or €50.00'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(afterDollar);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> notAfterMinus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;!-)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'a 10 b -20 c 30'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(notAfterMinus);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 引擎&#10;    participant S as &quot;$99.99&quot;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: 移动到 &quot;9&quot; 的位置&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: (?&lt;=$) 向左检查是否为 &quot;$&quot;&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;E: 是 &quot;$&quot;,断言成功&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: \\\\d+(\\\\.\\\\d{2})? 匹配 &quot;99.99&quot;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: 最终结果:&quot;99.99&quot;(不含 $)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 引擎\n    participant S as \"$99.99\"\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: 移动到 \"9\" 的位置\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: (?&lt;=$) 向左检查是否为 \"$\"\n    S--&gt;&gt;E: 是 \"$\",断言成功\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: \\\\d+(\\\\.\\\\d{2})? 匹配 \"99.99\"\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: 最终结果:\"99.99\"(不含 $)</pre><p>各语言对后顾断言的支持情况：</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言/引擎</th>\n<th>定长后顾</th>\n<th>变长后顾</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>ES2018 起支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>仅支持固定长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>支持有限变长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.NET</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go (RE2)</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>完全不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> Python 的 <code>re</code> 模块要求后顾断言内的模式长度固定。如果需要变长后顾，可以使用 <code>regex</code> 第三方库，或者改用其他策略（如捕获分组配合后处理）。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"断言的组合应用\">断言的组合应用</h2><p>前瞻和后顾可以灵活组合，实现复杂的定位需求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function formatNumber(num) {&#10;  return num.toString().replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, &#39;,&#39;);&#10;}&#10;formatNumber(1234567890);&#10;&#10;const betweenTags = /(?&lt;=&lt;b&gt;).*?(?=&lt;\\/b&gt;)/g;&#10;&#39;&lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt; text &lt;b&gt;more&lt;/b&gt;&#39;.match(betweenTags);&#10;&#10;const camelBoundary = /(?&lt;=[a-z])(?=[A-Z])/g;&#10;&#39;backgroundColor&#39;.split(camelBoundary);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\B</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?=(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{3}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">))</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">','</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234567890</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> betweenTags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;=&#x3C;b>)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?=&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">b>)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;b>bold&#x3C;/b> text &#x3C;b>more&#x3C;/b>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(betweenTags);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> camelBoundary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-z]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)(?=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[A-Z]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'backgroundColor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(camelBoundary);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合模式</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>(?&lt;=A)X(?=B)</code></td>\n<td>X 前是 A 后是 B</td>\n<td>提取标签间内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(?&lt;!A)X(?!B)</code></td>\n<td>X 前非 A 后非 B</td>\n<td>排除特定上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(?&lt;=A)(?=B)</code></td>\n<td>A 和 B 之间的位置</td>\n<td>驼峰拆分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(?=.*A)(?=.*B)X+</code></td>\n<td>包含 A 且包含 B</td>\n<td>多条件验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((前瞻与后顾断言))&#10;    零宽特性&#10;      不消费字符&#10;      只检查位置&#10;      不含在结果中&#10;    前瞻&#10;      &quot;&amp;#40;?=...&amp;#41; 正向&quot;&#10;      &quot;&amp;#40;?!...&amp;#41; 负向&quot;&#10;      可叠加实现与逻辑&#10;    后顾&#10;      &quot;&amp;#40;?&lt;=...&amp;#41; 正向&quot;&#10;      &quot;&amp;#40;?&lt;!...&amp;#41; 负向&quot;&#10;      跨语言支持差异&#10;    组合应用&#10;      千分位格式化&#10;      标签内容提取&#10;      驼峰命名拆分&#10;      密码强度验证\">mindmap\n  root((前瞻与后顾断言))\n    零宽特性\n      不消费字符\n      只检查位置\n      不含在结果中\n    前瞻\n      \"&amp;#40;?=...&amp;#41; 正向\"\n      \"&amp;#40;?!...&amp;#41; 负向\"\n      可叠加实现与逻辑\n    后顾\n      \"&amp;#40;?&lt;=...&amp;#41; 正向\"\n      \"&amp;#40;?&lt;!...&amp;#41; 负向\"\n      跨语言支持差异\n    组合应用\n      千分位格式化\n      标签内容提取\n      驼峰命名拆分\n      密码强度验证</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前瞻</strong>和<strong>后顾</strong>是零宽断言，检查位置前后的条件但不消费字符。</li>\n<li><strong>正向前瞻</strong> <code>(?=...)</code> 要求后面匹配，<strong>负向前瞻</strong> <code>(?!...)</code> 要求后面不匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>后顾断言</strong>检查前面的内容，JavaScript ES2018 起完整支持，部分语言有限制。</li>\n<li>多个前瞻叠加可实现&quot;逻辑与&quot;效果，是密码验证等多条件场景的经典技巧。</li>\n<li>前瞻与后顾的组合可以精确定位两个模式之间的位置，实现千分位分隔、驼峰拆分等功能。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前瞻与后顾断言","id":"前瞻与后顾断言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"断言的本质","id":"断言的本质"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"正向前瞻","id":"正向前瞻"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"负向前瞻","id":"负向前瞻"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"后顾断言","id":"后顾断言"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"断言的组合应用","id":"断言的组合应用"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分组与反向引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/advanced-patterns/groups-and-backreferences"},"next":{"title":"Unicode 与国际化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/advanced-patterns/unicode-and-internationalization"}}